# Markdown documents, including the fixed names that carry no extension.
# The extensionless documents are listed one path at a time.
*.md           diff=markdown
doc/GUIDELINES diff=markdown
doc/LICENSE    diff=markdown

# No file is given linguist-language. It does not make GitHub render a document
# that carries no extension, and setting it changed how doc/GUIDELINES and
# doc/LICENSE are displayed on the web, for the worse.

# doc/VERSIONS is underlined plain text, not Markdown. With diff=markdown its
# hunk headers lose the version line they now carry. doc/COPYING and
# doc/COPYING.LESSER are the licence texts.

# The vendored documents are not this repository's own. They are marked as
# vendored so that GitHub does not present them as documents of this repository.
emacs.d/elisp/3rd-party/**/README.md linguist-vendored
